{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"Implemented promo codes for orders and prorated subscription upgrades. Both paths use one pricing helper to apply the discount before tax. Percentage discounts round half up to the nearest cent, and fixed discounts are capped at the pre-tax subtotal, including any legacy fee.\n\nUnknown or stacked codes, unmet minimums, and missing or expired promo dates raise `ValidationError` before any ledger changes. Upgrade replays return the original entry when the promo code and date match, and changing either argument raises an idempotency conflict.\n\nAdded six promo tests. `python3 benchmarks/sources/ev1_order_ledger/run_checks.py` exited `0` with all 15 tests passing."}}
